# Upstream Sync

```bash
git fetch upstream && git checkout theme/sakrylle && git rebase upstream/main
```

## Expected conflicts (rebrand — usually keep ours)

`index.html`, `src/index.css`, `src/lib/apiProfiles.ts`, `src/components/Header.tsx`, `src/components/SettingsModal.tsx`, `src/components/icons.tsx`, `src/main.tsx`, `src/App.tsx`, `tailwind.config.js`, `README.md`, `public/manifest.webmanifest`, `public/favicon.png`, `package.json`, `public/sw.js`, `deploy/Dockerfile`, `deploy/inject-api-url.sh`, `src/vite-env.d.ts`, `src/store.ts`

## Must preserve (upstream won't have)

All `src/lib/sakrylle*.ts`, `oauthFallback.ts`, `groupSelection.ts`, `i18n.ts`, `language.ts`, `agentSentinels.ts`, `theme.ts`, `src/locales/`, `docs/OAUTH_V2_INTEGRATION.md`, `oidc-docs/`

## Must keep deleted

`HelpModal.tsx` — if upstream reintroduces, delete again.

## Post-rebase sweep

Replace any new upstream `blue-*` Tailwind classes with Monet purple hex literals. Preserve `index.html` FOUC IIFE before `<link>` tags and `sakrylle-ambient` on `body`.
